{#
  Comments panel (1.16): the UiKit side panel (`side_panel` theme partial, >= 2.25) on the right — an inline column
  >= 768 px, a full-height drawer <= 767 px — named by its heading "Comments". Open / closed comes from the server
  (?comments=1|0, else the viewer's remembered state: no flash); js/nowo-ui-side-panel.js opens and closes it in place
  and wiki.js stores the state (POST data-state-url, X-CSRF-Token data-state-token). The body is
  _comments_panel_body.html.twig through content_template (never `content`: comment text is user content, UiKit
  audit DU-I1).
  1.29: drawer_below (comments.dock_min_width: md | lg | xl) docks the panel only from that width (a drawer below; a
  server-open lg / xl panel starts closed there, UiKit LV-L2), persist (no session: localStorage, UiKit 2.48), and
  data-nowo-wiki-comments-requested (?comments=1): wiki.js opens the panel after load if it started closed.
  1.31: layout (comments.layout: inline | overlay; overlay = a drawer at every width, never opened from the remembered
  state).
  Variables: comments (WikiCommentsPanel::panel()), bundle.
#}
{% trans_default_domain 'NowoWikiBundle' %}
{% set _b = bundle|default(null) %}
{% set _title = 'wiki.comments.title'|trans %}
{{ include(nowo_ui_partial('side_panel', _b), {
    id: comments.id,
    title: _title,
    open: comments.open,
    side: 'end',
    layout: comments.layout|default('inline') == 'overlay' ? 'overlay' : 'inline',
    drawer_below: comments.drawer_below|default('md'),
    persist: comments.persist|default(null),
    close_href: comments.close_href,
    labels: {close: 'wiki.comments.close'|trans, opened: 'wiki.comments.opened'|trans, closed: 'wiki.comments.closed'|trans},
    content_template: '@NowoWikiBundle/manage/_comments_panel_body.html.twig',
    content_context: {comments: comments, bundle: _b},
    attr: {
        'data-testid': 'wiki-comments-panel',
        'data-nowo-wiki-comments': true,
        'data-state-url': comments.state_url,
        'data-state-token': comments.state_token,
        'data-reload-href': comments.reload_href|default(null),
        'data-nowo-wiki-comments-requested': comments.open_requested|default(false) ? true : null,
    },
    bundle: _b,
}, false) }}
